{
  "name": "Kia Stinger 3.3T (P-CAN)",
  "vehicle": "2018-2020 Kia Stinger 3.3T, Lambda II T-GDi",
  "bitrate": 500,
  "notes": "Powertrain/chassis bus at 500 kbit/s. 'verified' signals were checked against the car (tach, a logger, a JB4); 'dbc' come from comma's Hyundai/Kia DBC; 'observed' were worked out from captures, with scaling unknown where the unit says counts. Boost in psi assumes 101.3 kPa atmospheric, not the car's baro.",
